│
│  Trace assertion failed: expected res.S.ic.I.s = 6,
│  got: 5
│
├─➤ tests/trace/bad/trace_assertion.catala_en:5.10-11:
│   │
│ 5 │   output s content integer
│   │          ‾
└─
#return code 123#
